# Feature shipping

When the user asks to ship a feature, create a PR, push service changes, or do feature-wise code push:

1. Follow project skill `.cursor/skills/feature-pr/SKILL.md`.
2. Applies to **all** services/apps (`services/*`, `apps/*`, gateway, docs, compose) — not one service only.
3. Branch `feat/<service>-<slug>`; create if missing; push; `gh pr create`; return PR URL.
4. Never commit `.env` or secrets; never force-push main.
